# Mission control

```elixir
Mix.install([{:elixir_harness, path: "."}])
```

Every number is a BEAM introspection call. Boot it:

```sh
mix dashboard  # http://localhost:4000
```

Sections and their backends:

- Supervision tree — `Supervisor.which_children/1`, recursed.
- Agent workers — `DynamicSupervisor.which_children/1` joined with `:pg`.
- Tool runs — `:telemetry` events forwarded over PubSub, prepended live.
- Session prompt — `Session.to_prompt/1` TOON, on demand.

```elixir
{:ok, _} = ElixirHarness.Dashboard.boot(4000)
tasks = for i <- 1..6, do: {ElixirHarness.Tools.Math, %{"op" => "add", "a" => i, "b" => 0}}
ElixirHarness.Orchestrator.fan_out(tasks, max_concurrency: 6)
```

Or the narrated version: `mix showcase dashboard`.
No metrics agent, no polling daemon — the VM already knows everything.
